+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# COMBINATION combo-naive-c320-fd1-tiled-preattn-verify (log tags [combo], [c320], [tiled]).
+# Two disjoint row winners, each behind its own import-time gate, every other class on master:
+# SOURCE A (full decode_1, class FD1 = full layer, decode, batch 1, tp8, d 64, page 1): chunk320 of
+#   full-decode1-cuda-splitkv-chunk320 (impl 183eb55): splitkv_attn_kernel<320> + splitkv_combine_kernel
+#   <320, 16> ported verbatim as the NEW module muse_full_decode_c320 (only those two instantiations; master's
+#   v1 module and its <1024> code are untouched), after master's unpaired _pre_attention_kernel.
+# SOURCE B (verify classes SV1/SV16/SV32 sliding, FV1/FV16/FV32 full, q_len 8, page 1): the group-tiled
+#   pre-attention _pre_attention_tiled_kernel of preattention-tiled-gate-large-tokens (impl 880b01b) at
+#   kernel_fn's single pre-attention launch, per class.
+# Phases run after master's whole import sequence, on the module clock _IMPORT_T0 (started at the top of the
+# module): a phase starts only if now + its deadline <= _IMPORT_BUDGET_S, and a phase that finishes past its
+# deadline routes nothing. GATE A times kernel_fn itself with the FD1 route off, then on (graphs captured
+# with the module bool set once each); GATE B times kernel_fn with the class route off, then on. Both need
+# correctness + a two-state replay + interleaved cold-L2 graph timing at <= 0.98x to route. The route
+# tables (_C320_ROUTE bool, _TILED_ROUTE MappingProxyType) are final before any judge capture.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+_C320_CHUNK = 320  # tokens per work item: must match C320 in _C320_CUDA
